00:01:33.950 --> 00:01:37.760
April, 1590 - Izu Province - Nirayama Castle

00:01:52.970 --> 00:01:55.670
They're putting up quite a fight, even with our numbers.

00:01:55.920 --> 00:01:58.330
You can't help but appreciate the tenacity.

00:01:58.710 --> 00:02:00.290
Yes, that's right.

00:02:04.960 --> 00:02:07.170
Nirayama is famous for its bamboo.

00:02:08.150 --> 00:02:12.300
I wonder if I can find a chance to go out and find some.

00:02:15.820 --> 00:02:18.470
No, no! I can't!

00:02:20.490 --> 00:02:23.320
Being a warrior is tough.

00:02:40.990 --> 00:02:43.900
Might you be... Master Sen no Rikyū?

00:02:47.130 --> 00:02:52.990
He told me that you'll definitely come here when the Toyotomi army attacks.

00:02:53.710 --> 00:02:56.440
I've been looking all over for you.

00:02:57.460 --> 00:02:59.360
Who is looking for me?

00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:26.400
Sōji.

00:03:29.160 --> 00:03:34.710
It has been a while, Master.

00:03:35.540 --> 00:03:37.910
Kanto Survival

00:03:44.870 --> 00:03:46.940
You made me worry.

00:03:47.360 --> 00:03:51.230
I left Mount Kōya and have lived here in Sagami for a year.

00:03:52.800 --> 00:03:56.580
I came under the protection of Lord Hōjō Genan, who passed away last year.

00:03:56.960 --> 00:03:59.540
My life was content.

00:04:04.660 --> 00:04:07.360
What is that tea pot with the shape of Mt. Fuji?

00:04:09.930 --> 00:04:12.810
I had Odawara's metal caster make it for me.

00:04:13.560 --> 00:04:18.060
I guess you can say this is what I'm into now.

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:21.800
It's a bit embarrassing to admit that in front of you.

00:04:25.490 --> 00:04:28.090
You've changed, Sōji.

00:04:30.070 --> 00:04:32.010
You've matured.

00:04:32.830 --> 00:04:38.550
Just from this tea pot, I see that you are able to break free from the famed treasures and work with your own inspiration.

00:04:45.980 --> 00:04:50.110
I've been waiting for those words.

00:04:51.130 --> 00:04:57.160
I used to stand high above others, criticizing the works of others.

00:04:58.270 --> 00:05:02.050
But in actuality, I lacked the confidence in myself.

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:09.400
I was unable to surpass the natural beauty of the famed treasures.

00:05:11.380 --> 00:05:18.590
Then I met people who accepted me, even when I lack such treasures.

00:05:18.670 --> 00:05:20.380
That's when I started building my confidence.

00:05:21.080 --> 00:05:27.640
I finally learned the true way of the tea ceremony.

00:05:29.330 --> 00:05:34.310
When different tastes clash, it gives birth to something new.

00:05:34.450 --> 00:05:40.510
A golden tea room is great. So is the Jurakudai. Everything results from the pooling of ideas.

00:05:40.840 --> 00:05:42.610
I finally realized that.

00:05:45.940 --> 00:05:48.550
I used to be like that, too.

00:05:51.250 --> 00:05:59.170
I used to look down upon those who believed solely in their own tastes and creations of the tea ceremony.

00:05:59.860 --> 00:06:04.280
Taste is only a part of it. We must always research the true aesthete's way of tea.

00:06:05.150 --> 00:06:09.010
Let us go together and nurture our tastes.

00:06:10.370 --> 00:06:13.020
The true origin of imperfection.

00:06:16.970 --> 00:06:19.930
But there's no time left.

00:06:22.310 --> 00:06:26.980
200,000 troops have descended upon us. The Hōjō army cannot win.

00:06:27.520 --> 00:06:33.650
I am ready to be seen as the enemy.

00:06:34.240 --> 00:06:36.510
Don't force yourself anymore.

00:06:38.720 --> 00:06:42.830
Say your thanks to the ones who cared for you.

00:06:43.140 --> 00:06:46.320
Then return to the Toyotomi army.

00:06:47.270 --> 00:06:50.780
That is what Lord Hidenaga wants, even while sick in bed.

00:06:51.000 --> 00:06:51.790
But...

00:06:53.110 --> 00:06:55.450
I am a man of tea.

00:06:56.830 --> 00:07:01.060
I will use my name, Rikyū, as necessary.

00:07:01.490 --> 00:07:07.440
I'm sure the Chief Advisor will listen to my pleas for you.

00:07:11.810 --> 00:07:13.020
Thank you very much...

00:07:17.430 --> 00:07:20.350
Thank you so very much...

00:07:21.130 --> 00:07:24.760
April, 1590 - Sagami Province - Sōun Temple - Toyotomi Hideyoshi's Army Headquarters

00:07:26.800 --> 00:07:29.650
Good job, Ueda Satarō!

00:07:30.190 --> 00:07:32.990
Izuyamanaka Castle came down in just half a day!

00:07:33.180 --> 00:07:36.870
You're the best guy I've got!

00:07:36.950 --> 00:07:41.210
Thank you for the compliment. I have a request.

00:07:41.340 --> 00:07:42.050
Go on.

00:07:43.000 --> 00:07:45.000
I am a warrior,

00:07:45.630 --> 00:07:48.790
but I am embarrassed to say that I am nurturing the heart of an aesthete.

00:07:49.920 --> 00:07:53.630
Please let Master Rikyū teach me the way of the tea!

00:07:56.790 --> 00:08:01.190
Sure. You might be able to control that yapping of yours.

00:08:01.240 --> 00:08:04.890
You aren't so young anymore. I need to find you a wife.

00:08:07.990 --> 00:08:09.520
Due to recent events,

00:08:09.920 --> 00:08:14.150
I became Master Rikyū's disciple instead of you.

00:08:15.030 --> 00:08:16.730
I thought if I teamed up with you, Lord Ueda,

00:08:16.810 --> 00:08:19.860
we could have scaled up in our dealings.

00:08:21.020 --> 00:08:22.880
Where's Master Rikyū?

00:08:23.090 --> 00:08:25.850
He's at Ishigakiyama aiding in the castle's construction efforts.

00:08:26.510 --> 00:08:31.770
That will be Toyotomi's base of operations here. He's probably making it huge.

00:08:32.250 --> 00:08:35.860
I want to take a look at it before I take off.

00:08:37.500 --> 00:08:41.990
That shield on your back... Is it some new aesthete's thing?

00:08:44.920 --> 00:08:52.570
The 100 men left of Hōjō's Minagawa Hiroteru's army have surrendered to Lord Tokugawa.

00:08:52.670 --> 00:08:56.380
Tell Tokugawa to take care of them.

00:08:56.450 --> 00:09:00.410
Yamanoue Sōji is among the captured.

00:09:25.770 --> 00:09:29.020
Long time no see, Chief Advisor.

00:09:32.560 --> 00:09:34.390
Why did you come running back?

00:09:34.680 --> 00:09:40.020
I would like to learn the way of the tea from you once again.

00:09:40.250 --> 00:09:44.140
Nothing would make me happier.

00:09:44.700 --> 00:09:45.620
And...

00:09:46.330 --> 00:09:54.970
I would like you to spare the leader of the clan, Hōjō Ujinao, after the war.

00:09:58.130 --> 00:09:59.160
Mitsunari.

00:10:04.420 --> 00:10:10.440
I found these two books while checking the flow of goods leaving Sagami.

00:10:11.140 --> 00:10:14.350
First, regarding the seagull taro water kettle.

00:10:14.470 --> 00:10:18.700
"Considering the Chief Advisor's rank, why use something so commonplace?"

00:10:18.870 --> 00:10:21.250
Second, regarding the Hashitate tea pot.

00:10:21.360 --> 00:10:26.190
"Nothing's better than the wares Rikyū possesses."

00:10:27.900 --> 00:10:33.800
There are also accounts of proclaiming Nobunaga's famed treasures as second class.

00:10:37.400 --> 00:10:40.300
You ignored the eternal ruler of the heavens.

00:10:40.430 --> 00:10:45.030
As a mere commoner, how dare you judge the famed treasures? This is blasphemy!

00:10:45.630 --> 00:10:49.090
This is on the same level as drawing graffiti on the Jurakudai.

00:10:50.360 --> 00:10:53.210
I can tell by the handwriting that you are responsible for that, too!

00:10:54.200 --> 00:10:55.970
What else did you write!?

00:10:59.130 --> 00:11:00.130
Tell us!

00:11:00.830 --> 00:11:04.400
How much more of this slander did you write?
And who did you send them to?

00:11:18.100 --> 00:11:19.000
Tell us!

00:11:19.770 --> 00:11:24.800
I... I was young and immature...

00:11:29.400 --> 00:11:32.590
Sōji has turned anew.

00:11:32.780 --> 00:11:35.120
Please be kind to him.

00:11:35.890 --> 00:11:38.600
You probably judged the style of my clothing, Sōji.

00:11:40.530 --> 00:11:44.340
Tell me what you think of these favorite clothes of mine.

00:12:00.860 --> 00:12:02.260
Come on now.

00:12:09.860 --> 00:12:14.080
I do not think they are fit for the times we live in...

00:12:28.010 --> 00:12:31.610
There's nothing left for me to do.

00:12:34.940 --> 00:12:35.610
Do it.

00:13:55.170 --> 00:13:57.370
Curses...

00:13:59.860 --> 00:14:14.090
How dare you... How dare you kill the seeds of a true aesthete...

00:14:14.700 --> 00:14:18.410
April, 1590 - Sagami Province - Sōun Temple - Toyotomi Hideyoshi's Army Headquarters

00:14:25.010 --> 00:14:26.730
Hello, Lord Tadaoki.

00:14:28.070 --> 00:14:30.860
How is Master doing?

00:14:31.770 --> 00:14:34.490
It seems to be the cold.

00:14:35.100 --> 00:14:38.410
He's not looking too well, with massive diarrhea.

00:14:38.560 --> 00:14:39.860
Let me go take a look.

00:14:39.920 --> 00:14:40.790
Stop!

00:14:42.970 --> 00:14:47.030
I do not think he wants to see a warrior's face right now.

00:14:51.230 --> 00:14:53.080
Is it because of Sōji?

00:14:53.500 --> 00:14:54.750
Of course.

00:14:54.950 --> 00:15:00.750
He just lost a disciple he's known for a long time.

00:15:01.170 --> 00:15:05.040
If I had a secret book of my way of tea,

00:15:05.400 --> 00:15:08.300
I wouldn't be so careless for Lord Ishida to find it.

00:15:08.880 --> 00:15:11.060
Even after his nose and ears were cut off,

00:15:11.280 --> 00:15:16.160
he never revealed who the books were written for.

00:15:18.970 --> 00:15:20.490
He was amazing man.

00:15:21.190 --> 00:15:28.130
Perhaps, after hundred of years, his resolve will be remembered.

00:15:29.740 --> 00:15:32.500
Please be careful on your trip.

00:15:32.870 --> 00:15:37.610
You too, Lord Tadaoki. Control your temper and don't get scolded by Lord Yūsai.

00:15:38.580 --> 00:15:40.270
I have some good news.

00:15:40.780 --> 00:15:44.840
Data of Oū has surrendered to Toyotomi forces and will be joining forces with us.

00:15:45.340 --> 00:15:48.560
We won't need to fight all the way up north now.

00:15:48.840 --> 00:15:51.800
We don't know yet until we meet with him face to face.

00:15:52.530 --> 00:15:55.180
But it seems we will both be able to cut down on our army spending.

00:15:55.730 --> 00:15:56.810
I see.

00:15:57.140 --> 00:15:57.960
I'll be off.

00:16:00.350 --> 00:16:05.530
I should take a trip to Ishigakiyama before I head out.

00:16:06.380 --> 00:16:10.230
I hope I can find a way to cheer Master up.

00:16:11.050 --> 00:16:14.720
Mutsu Province - Kurokawa Castle

00:16:13.680 --> 00:16:15.260
I am really sorry!

00:16:16.730 --> 00:16:19.500
I controlled over half of Oū's 66 cities.

00:16:19.780 --> 00:16:21.700
The Date family has ruled always ruled Tōkoku!

00:16:21.950 --> 00:16:25.670
We will not bow down to that Toyotomi monkey!

00:16:26.350 --> 00:16:30.940
You killed off your younger brother and exiled your mother to get Oū.

00:16:31.120 --> 00:16:33.850
Perhaps we should let the Chief Advisor...

00:16:34.620 --> 00:16:36.630
What are you saying!?

00:16:36.830 --> 00:16:41.320
Lord Masamune is hurting the most here!

00:16:41.420 --> 00:16:43.410
No, Katakura.

00:16:43.600 --> 00:16:47.510
I'm not hurting at all.

00:16:49.190 --> 00:16:51.610
This is only temporary.

00:16:52.000 --> 00:16:55.360
I'm just lending him Oū for the time being!

00:16:55.810 --> 00:16:59.840
When the Chief Advisor lets his guard down, then I will strike back!

00:17:00.650 --> 00:17:04.500
I'll rule over the entire nation!

00:17:07.020 --> 00:17:10.690
Isn't that right, Monk Kosai?

00:17:10.760 --> 00:17:12.610
Do not be looked down upon!

00:17:19.780 --> 00:17:21.910
Do not be looked down upon!

00:17:25.820 --> 00:17:28.660
A golden line in the shape of a snake!

00:17:29.800 --> 00:17:32.620
As expected from Monk Kosai who had lived in Kyoto!

00:17:33.030 --> 00:17:35.730
What a splendid item!

00:17:36.770 --> 00:17:40.430
You want me to wear this and go to Odawara?

00:17:40.660 --> 00:17:44.060
So I can show him the guts of a true warrior?

00:17:44.260 --> 00:17:46.300
Do not be looked down upon!

00:17:50.310 --> 00:17:53.110
I want to meet with Master Rikyū!

00:17:53.680 --> 00:17:58.260
Right now!

00:17:59.360 --> 00:18:02.960
Sagami Province - Ishigakiyama Castle Construction Grounds

00:18:19.690 --> 00:18:21.050
Hurry!

00:18:21.420 --> 00:18:23.680
We may have few men here,

00:18:23.850 --> 00:18:29.310
but we must complete the construction for our Lord Hidenaga who's sick in bed!

00:18:30.210 --> 00:18:31.030
Father!

00:18:32.290 --> 00:18:37.580
Lord Fushin Bugyō wants to know how you want the main castle tower to look like.

00:18:37.670 --> 00:18:38.620
I have no idea.

00:18:38.820 --> 00:18:41.160
The Chief Advisor wants us to build it fast with splendor.

00:18:41.160 --> 00:18:44.660
Since we're in a hurry, just use normal walls.

00:18:48.230 --> 00:18:49.650
How boring.

00:18:49.870 --> 00:18:53.490
This is a great chance to show off our superior tastes.

00:18:54.900 --> 00:18:57.030
What are you thinking?

00:18:57.680 --> 00:19:01.590
Your job is to treat our generals to good tea.

00:19:02.000 --> 00:19:05.290
That is why I brought a minor like you along.

00:19:12.480 --> 00:19:14.480
It's Lord Oribe!

00:19:14.560 --> 00:19:15.660
What should I do?

00:19:15.760 --> 00:19:20.250
My heart isn't ready yet! What a man!

00:19:21.700 --> 00:19:24.380
This is pretty good.

00:19:25.050 --> 00:19:28.520
If you hang this golden decoration on the roof of the main tower,

00:19:29.080 --> 00:19:31.990
the Odawara army will be pissing in their pants.

00:19:32.950 --> 00:19:37.420
As long as the Chief Advisor likes it, your name will rise once again.

00:19:37.870 --> 00:19:39.400
Lord Honami Kōetsu.

00:19:39.630 --> 00:19:43.670
This is what my father likes, not what I like.

00:19:46.350 --> 00:19:48.550
In any case, Lord Oribe.

00:19:51.490 --> 00:19:56.330
This Magoroku blade is peerless. Be sure to oil it properly.

00:19:56.610 --> 00:19:57.820
You found out?

00:19:59.470 --> 00:20:04.060
So many commanders gave you their swords. Your eyes are good.

00:20:04.590 --> 00:20:09.070
Well, I'm making something even better than swords now.

00:20:10.020 --> 00:20:11.420
What is it?

00:20:12.160 --> 00:20:13.990
I can't tell you yet.

00:20:14.570 --> 00:20:16.510
Don't leave me hanging! Give me a hint...

00:20:16.610 --> 00:20:19.150
I'm here to see Lord Furuta.

00:20:20.640 --> 00:20:26.690
I am here on behalf of Chief Councilor Lord Hidenaga. My name is Kobori Shinsuke.

00:20:26.830 --> 00:20:31.180
I am here to thank you properly for helping with the construction efforts.

00:20:31.380 --> 00:20:35.500
No need to be so polite. We aren't strangers.

00:20:40.470 --> 00:20:42.190
Hey! Say something!

00:20:45.540 --> 00:20:50.720
I'm in charge of serving tea on behalf of Lord Hidenaga! My name is Kobori Sakusuke!

00:20:51.190 --> 00:20:52.690
Look at my useless son.

00:20:53.080 --> 00:20:56.730
Just because he was praised by Master Rikyū once,

00:20:56.840 --> 00:21:00.300
he only knows aesthetics now and has forgotten all about the way of the warrior.

00:21:00.370 --> 00:21:02.330
Oh? By Master?

00:21:02.460 --> 00:21:07.050
Hey! Aren't you going to tell him about your idea?

00:21:08.340 --> 00:21:10.300
It's beyond my status...

00:21:11.810 --> 00:21:12.710
Spill it out.

00:21:25.710 --> 00:21:29.690
If we get shoji paper from Yamato...

00:21:30.250 --> 00:21:33.120
...and then put them up on all the walls in the main tower...

00:21:36.040 --> 00:21:40.520
I think it'll show off a brilliant white effect...

00:21:49.110 --> 00:21:50.020
Sounds interesting.

00:21:52.620 --> 00:21:53.610
Quite interesting.

00:21:56.190 --> 00:21:58.460
That will be much faster than painting the walls.

00:21:58.990 --> 00:22:01.420
I'll go talk with the chief of construction.

00:22:06.260 --> 00:22:07.650
I was praised...

00:22:07.970 --> 00:22:10.690
I was praised by the great Lord Oribe...

00:22:12.350 --> 00:22:13.490
Sounds interesting.

00:22:14.130 --> 00:22:15.380
I'm so happy!

00:22:15.650 --> 00:22:18.280
I'm closer to achieving my dreams!

00:22:19.400 --> 00:22:24.780
I had a dream while at Oū. I saw a brilliant white castle like Azuchi!

00:22:25.690 --> 00:22:27.610
Kobori Sakusuke, eh?

00:22:28.830 --> 00:22:30.410
He's not bad.

00:22:30.700 --> 00:22:33.680
Such potential at such a young age.

00:22:43.560 --> 00:22:45.430
There's no stopping this.

00:22:46.170 --> 00:22:47.750
The birth of a true aesthete.

00:23:03.490 --> 00:23:06.220
Everytime I　

00:23:03.490 --> 00:23:06.220
Anata no mune

00:23:06.380 --> 00:23:08.610
feel your heart

00:23:06.380 --> 00:23:08.610
Fureru sonotabi

00:23:09.340 --> 00:23:14.700
Your burning, sincere passion singes me.

00:23:09.340 --> 00:23:14.700
Yakedoshisou na shinshi na jounetsu

00:23:15.620 --> 00:23:20.880
Were the world to turn against you, my dear love

00:23:15.620 --> 00:23:20.880
Sekai juu wo teki ni mawashitatte

00:23:21.730 --> 00:23:27.040
Oppose its rotation and return to me.

00:23:21.730 --> 00:23:27.040
Mezashitanara douzo tsuranuite kudasai

00:23:27.880 --> 00:23:33.130
Men are alike butterflies, as women are alike flowers.

00:23:27.880 --> 00:23:33.130
Otoko wa chouchou de onna wa hana de

00:23:34.130 --> 00:23:37.010
Through heaven and earth,

00:23:34.130 --> 00:23:37.010
Kuu to daichi to demo

00:23:37.240 --> 00:23:40.590
Are also alike, we all choose to live.

00:23:37.240 --> 00:23:40.590
Onaji asu wo eraberuno

00:23:40.790 --> 00:23:46.460
Should we be seperated by the flow of time?

00:23:40.790 --> 00:23:46.460
Toki ni nagasare kyouri ni hanasareru

00:23:46.560 --> 00:23:49.460
We must continue living our lives

00:23:46.560 --> 00:23:49.460
Kizuna nante kizunajynai

00:23:49.540 --> 00:23:52.070
Without each other.

00:23:49.540 --> 00:23:52.070
Omoumama ikite　

00:23:52.160 --> 00:23:53.030
You should

00:23:52.160 --> 00:23:53.030
Soshite

00:23:53.120 --> 00:23:58.530
Ascend the heavens and look below.

00:23:53.120 --> 00:23:58.530
Nobotta itadakikara mieru

00:23:58.640 --> 00:24:02.320
Show me the scenery in my dreams.

00:23:58.640 --> 00:24:02.320
Keshiki wo oshiete itsuka

00:24:02.380 --> 00:24:08.030
Even though we fall in love and drown in passion,

00:24:02.380 --> 00:24:08.030
Koi ni ochiteku ai ni oboreteku

00:24:08.110 --> 00:24:14.520
I desire my wish fulfilled, above this happiness we both share.

00:24:08.110 --> 00:24:14.520
Watashi no kono shiawase yori kanaetai negai sore wa

00:24:14.580 --> 00:24:20.320
I desire your pursuit of beautiful things.

00:24:14.580 --> 00:24:20.320
Anata no ou utsukushii mono

00:24:21.800 --> 00:24:26.300
So abide by my desire, for eternity.

00:24:21.800 --> 00:24:26.300
Kowasarenaide eien ni

00:24:36.370 --> 00:24:37.880
So casual.

00:24:43.120 --> 00:24:44.870
Damn flies...

00:24:48.650 --> 00:24:50.380
Oh! Edo!

00:24:50.530 --> 00:24:52.500
Edo Frontier.

00:24:53.340 --> 00:24:57.730
To be a warrior or an aesthete? That is the question.

00:24:56.270 --> 00:24:59.560
Edo Frontier
